{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021093440271-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021102413\"/><p>消防接報到場將傷者救出。</p><p>屯門發生交通意外。今日(21日)早上9時20分，一輛泥頭車與一輛貨車沿元朗公路往元朗方向行駛，至近福亨村對開時兩車意外相撞，貨車車頭嚴重損毀司機受傷被困。消防接報到場將傷者救出交救護車送院治理，泥頭車司機在場助查肇事原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T02:39:24.082742+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T01:34:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:37:59.599578+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T02:37:41.408343+00:00","content_hash":"67e4c40061ad7fc27a765841c7bb79fb82bded6a4cbfb4cd83ad7fe18c83ff48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}